-5.  **Shading and Compositing:** For the segment of the ray inside the element, apply shading methods similar to those used for rectilinear volumes [S1]. This typically involves sampling the scalar data within the element, mapping it to color/opacity via a transfer function, and compositing the result along the ray [S1].
